      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The target is the first published October monthly change in BLS CES0000000001, seasonally adjusted total nonfarm employment, Table B-1. All payroll anchors and historical observations use that same variant. HistoricalContext records each month's original first-print change. Resolution subtracts the September level appearing alongside October in the initial October release, rather than September's previously published level."
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The official calendar verifies publication on November 6, 2026, at 08:30 Eastern: [BLS November calendar](https://www.bls.gov/schedule/2026/11_sched.htm). The registered API endpoint was inaccessible through the web tool; official BLS releases supplied all six historical prints."
      },
      {
